The cause most of the reports share stays #4471: the shared parser reads every date month first, and these tenants write the day first.

The other cause is `hint`. Through booking-v3 the form prints MM/DD/YYYY. People type what the hint says. The form still reads the date the tenant's way. That is a different bug.

Five reports under `parser` were already read as a one-day move. They stay counted where they are filed.

